{"id":"vod_md_5298","vodId":"5298","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"七魔剑支配天下","name_cn":"七魔剑支配天下","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"15集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230920-1/70b2038bc0d26fe16cef86d402492c95.jpg"},"summary":"春天──名校金伯利魔法学校今年也有新生入学。他们身穿黑色长袍，将白杖与杖剑扠在腰间，内心怀抱著骄傲与使命。迎接这些新手魔法师的，是开满樱花的盛开之路与魔法生物的游行。然而，他们也只有一开始能够满怀期待。金伯利内暗藏著各种威胁，会随意吞噬学生的地下迷宫，像怪物一样的高年级学生，以及围绕亚人种的人权议题展开的派系斗争──奥利佛努力与同伴一起在这样的魔境当中求生，并在这段期间遇见了於腰间扠著一把日本刀的武士少女──奈奈绪，与她缔下不解之缘。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-16 08:08:55","episodeCount":15,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/LuL58eDS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/1DRaMwkc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/dmChejaW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/4ptOBt2h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/E3KN2eE1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/uj5VBweR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/wuuVZC5I/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/ASZWyD24/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/yOrb9gdO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/VzgeWUpj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230918/tzAnxNRC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230925/eiMqv6X1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231001/zvONl15s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/fiUEHOW4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231015/kcqetav3/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:47.014Z"}